{"2866690": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Secrets of the Silent School", "steam_appid": 2866690, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Synopsis:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secrets of the Silent School is a first-person horror game where players control a drone to investigate an abandoned Japanese school. Collect data to uncover the truth hidden within its haunted halls, while using your camera to capture and destroy vengeful ghosts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Description:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Years after a tragic massacre in the school, the government has launched a covert investigation to uncover what really happened.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the Operator, remotely controlling a drone tasked with collecting data and surviving nightly missions inside the haunted school. But the spirits trapped within are not passive. They are watching. They are angry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Capture ghosts with your camera to destroy them</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Collect data to uncover the truth. Reach 50% or face a bad ending.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Limited time each night. 15 minutes to explore, and survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Atmospheric horror inspired by Japanese folklore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Discover notes written by the victims and piece together the mystery. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Two different endings: Good and Bad.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Synopsis:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secrets of the Silent School is a first-person horror game where players control a drone to investigate an abandoned Japanese school. Collect data to uncov